%N A399197 Number of nonnegative integer solutions to the equation x^2 + 4*y^2 = n.
%H A399197 Seiichi Manyama, <a href="/A399197/b399197.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 0..10000</a>
%o A399197 (PARI) a(n, k=4) = sum(i=0, sqrtint(n), sum(j=0, sqrtint(n\k), i^2+k*j^2==n));
